 Values
   ('SEC-0034', 'SEC', 'SEC-0034 : Password fail count has reached its limit. User id is locked.', 'SEC-0034 : 암호 실패 횟수가 한계에 도달하여 이 User ID는 잠겼습니다.', 'SEC-0034 : Der Password-Fail-Count hat sein limit erreicht. DieUser ID ist blockiert.', 'ADMIN', '20060405143426', 'ADMIN', '20081218131949');	
